LiquidLaneSignatureValidator
├── request policy
│   ├── accepts positive requests with all outputs owned by the adapter
│   └── rejects zero inputs, empty outputs, zero outputs and wrong recipients or protocol
├── digest binding
│   ├── matches the Reactor across arbitrary amounts, nonces and output arrays
│   └── rejects altered request fields, chain, Reactor and caller
├── adapter authorization
│   ├── requires the exact saved validator envelope
│   ├── permits masked amounts but pins validator, tokens and recipients
│   ├── permits multiple independent requests for one token
│   ├── clears authorization without touching funds or nonces
│   └── rejects malformed and empty validator data
├── lifetime
│   ├── accepts the exact deadline and rejects expired requests
│   └── uses Reactor nonce cancellation and consumption for replay protection
└── real Reactor settlement
    ├── transfers RWA from the adapter and payment back to it
    ├── requires allowance independently from saved signature authorization
    └── invalidates filled signatures and rejects replay without any capability installation
